class: runtime
profiles: standard
summary: the Benchmark Game pidigits workload takes its count of digits as an argument, the correctness input thirty, and runs Gibbons' unbounded spigot over core/big's integers, every step computing into values the loop keeps, printing the digits ten to a line with their running count
constructs: 0050, 0150, 0160, 0290, 0310, 0350, 0400, 0520, 0630, 0670, 0710, 0900, 1150
program: main.ldn
root: ../../../../..
run_args: 30
run_expect: output.txt
status: 0
stream: output
targets: linux-x86-64, linux-arm64, darwin-arm64, freebsd-x86-64, freebsd-arm64, linux-rv64, windows-x86-64, windows-arm64
